{"id":"38545b094b915076","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md","title":"Essential Incompleteness of Effective Extensions","display":"thm-essentially-undecidable — Essential Incompleteness of Effective Extensions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-essentially-undecidable","aliases":["92-thm-essentially-undecidable"],"display":"thm-essentially-undecidable — Essential Incompleteness of Effective Extensions","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-complete-system]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]"],"source":"第 VI 章 pp. 75–81；第 X 章 p. 112（PDF 92–98、129）","source_status":"原书本质不完备性的本地推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-essentially-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-essentially-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-essentially-undecidable — Essential Incompleteness of Effective Extensions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c04baacf4202d9f7\" href=\"?note=c04baacf4202d9f7\" title=\"92-df-complete-system\">92-df-complete-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VI 章 pp. 75–81；第 X 章 p. 112（PDF 92–98、129）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书本质不完备性的本地推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(A&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;=(\\Sigma_G,A&#39;,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\">\\(G&#39;=(\\Sigma_G,A&#39;,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\)</span> (candidate same-calculus extension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\)</span> (axiom-set projection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem},\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem},\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span> (elementarity, consistency, and syntactic-completeness predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\forall G&#39;\\;\\Bigl[\nG&#39;=(\\Sigma_G,A&#39;,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\land\n\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A&#39;\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G&#39;)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}(G&#39;)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\forall G&#39;\\;\\Bigl[\nG&#39;=(\\Sigma_G,A&#39;,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\land\n\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A&#39;\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G&#39;)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}(G&#39;)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本质不完备：任何相容且有效公理化的扩展都不完备</li>\n<li>这里“扩展”已具体化为同一<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言、同一Hilbert规则且包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>全部公理的系统，避免把形式系统三元组直接写成集合包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\\supseteq G\">\\(G&#39;\\supseteq G\\)</span></li>\n<li>系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>因含PA的相应算术强度而满足本质不完备结论</li>\n<li>若删除有效性限制，真算术就是相容且完备的扩展，因此原来的无条件“任何扩展”表述是错误的</li>\n<li>这是比单系统不完备更强的结果</li>\n<li>与Rosser定理相关：本质不完备只需一致性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>给 G 的同演算一致有效扩展应用一般定理：它继承可证的 Q 及逻辑公理。该文件 Assertion 表达本质不完备；统一定理码不可判定性还要另给可计算论证，标题的 essentially undecidable 不能代替那个证明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VI 章 pp. 75–81；第 X 章 p. 112（PDF 92–98、129）。</p>\n<p>本条沿用旧文件名和引用标签，但显示标题现在直接对应 Assertion 的本质不完备结论。定理集不可判定的更强表述须用独立的有效归约结果，不由这一标题自动获得。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-complete-system","status":"resolved","id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-generalization","status":"resolved","id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-generalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}$ (axiom-set projection, see [[92-df-axiom-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"A'\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G'=(\\Sigma_G,A',\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem},\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Complete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A'\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\forall G'\\;\\Bigl[\nG'=(\\Sigma_G,A',\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\land\n\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A'\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G')\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G')\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}(G')\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G'\\supseteq G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2529,"backlinks":[{"id":"7c6a45591fbdd08e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c762edc5b4f95fbd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e9a4da37b8e411f7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"52184c84df392b80","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable]]"}],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","c7befd96bd551ade","c04baacf4202d9f7","360e00ddf38f0f16","35c764f4e9f21f28","5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","16613851c4bce386","906680bfce5f44c0"]}